Package: lupa
Title: Data Profiling and Quality Measurement
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sebastián", "Lucas", , "sebalucas@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Profiles administrative data, discovers structural patterns in
    character columns, infers implicit types, identifies mixed date formats,
    and returns reusable findings about potential data issues. Defines reusable
    quality metrics with explicit granularity, typed aggregation, evaluation
    profiles, and a traceable mapping to the framework metric catalogue.
    Produces editable cleaning plans and applies only explicitly
    selected actions while retaining an audit log. The conceptual basis is the
    Data Quality Management Framework for
    Digital Government, version 1.6, published by AGESIC (2020)
    <https://www.gub.uy/agencia-gobierno-electronico-sociedad-informacion-conocimiento/>.
License: GPL-2 | GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
